{"step_index":148,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T01:11:27Z","thinking":"Initial inspection reveals potentially problematic data: \"비공개\" in the address field (row 90), a dummy phone number (row 96), and an incomplete domain (row 97). The business rule is that \"비공개\" should be converted to an empty string in the address field. A complete audit is required to ensure data integrity. Creating a script to systematically review all values across the dataset is the next step.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Audit script for all columns in output.tsv","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nconst outFile = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fc47ed12-b523-4d84-9421-40e6756ddcef/scratch/output.tsv';\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync(outFile, 'utf8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n\nconsole.log(`Auditing ${lines.length} lines...`);\n\nconst issues = [];\n\nlines.forEach((line, idx) => {\n  const c = line.split('\\t');\n  if (c.length !== 18) {\n    issues.push(`Row ${idx}: wrong col count ${c.length}`);\n  }\n  // Check stars\n  for (let i = 0; i < c.length; i++) {\n    if (c[i].includes('*')) {\n      issues.push(`Row ${idx} Col ${i}: has star: \"${c[i]}\"`);\n    }\n  }\n  // Check phone\n  if (c[7] && (c[7].includes('000-0000') || c[7].length < 8)) {\n    issues.push(`Row ${idx} Col 7 (tel): suspicious tel \"${c[7]}\"`);\n  }\n  if (c[8] && (c[8].includes('000-0000') || c[8].length < 8)) {\n    issues.push(`Row ${idx} Col 8 (fax): suspicious fax \"${c[8]}\"`);\n  }\n  // Check URL\n  if (c[9]) {\n    if (!c[9].includes('.') || c[9].endsWith('/.') || c[9].length < 8) {\n      issues.push(`Row ${idx} Col 9 (url): suspicious url \"${c[9]}\"`);\n    }\n  }\n  // Check email\n  if (c[10]) {\n    if (!c[10].includes('@') || !c[10].includes('.')) {\n      issues.push(`Row ${idx} Col 10 (email): suspicious email \"${c[10]}\"`);\n    }\n  }\n  // Check address\n  if (c[6] === '비공개' || c[6] === '-') {\n    issues.push(`Row ${idx} Col 6 (addr): invalid addr \"${c[6]}\"`);\n  }\n});\n\nconsole.log(`Found ${issues.length} issues:`);\nconsole.log(issues.slice(0, 30));\n","Description":"Audit script for output data","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\fc47ed12-b523-4d84-9421-40e6756ddcef\\scratch\\audit_output.js","toolAction":"Writing audit script","toolSummary":"Create audit script"}}]}
